  },
  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "00:53:57,555",
      "end": "00:54:00,525",
      "text": "Holy moly, it really is."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:00,558",
      "end": "00:54:03,194",
      "text": "He doesn't look so scary."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:03,228",
      "end": "00:54:05,096",
      "text": "Mr. Calloway!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:05,929",
      "end": "00:54:08,099",
      "text": "- Go away! - No, please."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:08,133",
      "end": "00:54:10,402",
      "text": "We-we-we just want to talk to you for one minute."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:10,435",
      "end": "00:54:12,237",
      "text": "That's all."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:13,904",
      "end": "00:54:17,342",
      "text": "We are not leaving until you talk to us."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:18,476",
      "end": "00:54:20,844",
      "text": "Fine. If you're not coming over here,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:20,878",
      "end": "00:54:22,980",
      "text": "we're coming over to you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:23,013",
      "end": "00:54:24,848",
      "text": "No! Stay off the fence!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:54:24,882",
      "end": "00:54:26,284",
      "text": "Don't listen to him."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:00,352",
      "end": "00:55:01,619",
      "text": "Stop, stop, stop!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:01,653",
      "end": "00:55:03,555",
      "text": "Porsha, you're still messing it up."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:03,588",
      "end": "00:55:05,457",
      "text": "It's not my fault."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:05,490",
      "end": "00:55:07,392",
      "text": "He keeps missing the catch."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:07,425",
      "end": "00:55:09,893",
      "text": "I think she's trying to kill me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:09,927",
      "end": "00:55:11,429",
      "text": "Reset. Let's go again."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:11,463",
      "end": "00:55:13,164",
      "text": "Meena! Darius!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:13,198",
      "end": "00:55:15,400",
      "text": "We're coming to you next, and I better see"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:15,433",
      "end": "00:55:17,669",
      "text": "some chemistry between you two."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:17,702",
      "end": "00:55:20,105",
      "text": "Okay, let's run these steps one more time."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:20,138",
      "end": "00:55:23,675",
      "text": "So, music starts, I step out,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:23,708",
      "end": "00:55:25,976",
      "text": "do my moves, fancy moves."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:26,009",
      "end": "00:55:27,412",
      "text": "Step together, drop."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:27,445",
      "end": "00:55:32,083",
      "text": "Gazing at each other like we're burning up with love..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:32,950",
      "end": "00:55:35,018",
      "text": "What are you doing with your face?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:36,521",
      "end": "00:55:38,289",
      "text": "Your face looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:38,323",
      "end": "00:55:39,657",
      "text": "What is that?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:39,691",
      "end": "00:55:41,126",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:41,159",
      "end": "00:55:43,628",
      "text": "I was falling in love?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:43,661",
      "end": "00:55:45,563",
      "text": "Yeah, Gina, listen."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:45,597",
      "end": "00:55:47,699",
      "text": "I'm sorry, that-that's not what"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:47,732",
      "end": "00:55:49,501",
      "text": "falling in love with me looks like."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:49,534",
      "end": "00:55:51,069",
      "text": "I... I should know."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:51,102",
      "end": "00:55:53,036",
      "text": "I see it day after day, week after week."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:53,071",
      "end": "00:55:55,038",
      "text": "Let's run it again."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:55,073",
      "end": "00:55:57,609",
      "text": "From the top! And five, six, seven, eight."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:55:57,642",
      "end": "00:55:59,411",
      "text": "And one..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:03,548",
      "end": "00:56:06,418",
      "text": "Would you like some ice cream, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:06,451",
      "end": "00:56:10,321",
      "text": "Or should I say, Your Majesty?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:11,322",
      "end": "00:56:12,290",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:12,323",
      "end": "00:56:14,359",
      "text": "I just... You look like a goddess,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:14,392",
      "end": "00:56:17,195",
      "text": "and, uh... and-and-and lucky for you,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:17,228",
      "end": "00:56:19,697",
      "text": "it's \"free ice cream for all goddesses\" day."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:19,731",
      "end": "00:56:22,534",
      "text": "Aw."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:34,145",
      "end": "00:56:37,282",
      "text": "That's cherry cheesecake, and I-I make it all myself."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:37,315",
      "end": "00:56:39,317",
      "text": "See, my truck's right over there."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:39,350",
      "end": "00:56:41,319",
      "text": "Come by anytime..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:41,352",
      "end": "00:56:43,288",
      "text": "Your Majesty."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:56:45,156",
      "end": "00:56:47,991",
      "text": "Ooh, that... Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:00,738",
      "end": "00:57:02,774",
      "text": "Buster?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:04,642",
      "end": "00:57:06,377",
      "text": "You okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:07,245",
      "end": "00:57:09,647",
      "text": "Ash?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:09,681",
      "end": "00:57:11,483",
      "text": "Where are we?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:12,450",
      "end": "00:57:14,252",
      "text": "We're in Clay's house."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:14,285",
      "end": "00:57:15,086",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:15,119",
      "end": "00:57:17,255",
      "text": "- Have you talked to him yet? - Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:17,288",
      "end": "00:57:19,390",
      "text": "- You have? - We were just discussing"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:19,424",
      "end": "00:57:21,493",
      "text": "whether he'd consider being in our show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:21,526",
      "end": "00:57:22,660",
      "text": "What did he say?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:22,694",
      "end": "00:57:24,696",
      "text": "He said no."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:24,729",
      "end": "00:57:28,433",
      "text": "Not in a million years."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:29,434",
      "end": "00:57:31,302",
      "text": "Please, Mr. Calloway."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:31,336",
      "end": "00:57:33,505",
      "text": "Look, you don't... you don't realize how much"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:33,538",
      "end": "00:57:36,107",
      "text": "it would mean to have you in our show and..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:36,140",
      "end": "00:57:37,609",
      "text": "Will you stop your yakking?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:39,677",
      "end": "00:57:41,079",
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:41,112",
      "end": "00:57:44,382",
      "text": "Your friend left this on my property."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:50,455",
      "end": "00:57:53,191",
      "text": "And I want you gone in the morning."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:55,460",
      "end": "00:57:59,163",
      "text": "And that's why they say, \"Never meet your heroes.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:57:59,764",
      "end": "00:58:02,267",
      "text": "Step, two, three, four."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:02,300",
      "end": "00:58:04,402",
      "text": "One, two, three, four."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:04,435",
      "end": "00:58:05,603",
      "text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:07,171",
      "end": "00:58:08,473",
      "text": "Whoa, mate."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:08,506",
      "end": "00:58:10,775",
      "text": "You're not ready to be busting out these moves."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:10,808",
      "end": "00:58:12,310",
      "text": "- Sorry. - Look at you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:12,343",
      "end": "00:58:14,245",
      "text": "Klaus has thrown you in the deep end"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:14,279",
      "end": "00:58:16,681",
      "text": "and drained out all of your confidence like..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:18,850",
      "end": "00:58:20,718",
      "text": "Don't worry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:20,752",
      "end": "00:58:22,453",
      "text": "We'll build up to it step-by-step."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:22,487",
      "end": "00:58:25,123",
      "text": "Just forget what Klaus told you and go with the flow."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:25,156",
      "end": "00:58:26,491",
      "text": "♪ Hey, uh, uh ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:26,524",
      "end": "00:58:29,327",
      "text": "♪ I'd rather be nobody other than me ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:29,360",
      "end": "00:58:31,329",
      "text": "♪ Mark my words, my talk ain't cheap ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:31,362",
      "end": "00:58:34,198",
      "text": "♪ Life's a dream, but I'm not sleep ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:34,232",
      "end": "00:58:36,801",
      "text": "♪ I, I feel like a work of art ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:36,834",
      "end": "00:58:38,736",
      "text": "♪ I'm not easily forgot ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:38,770",
      "end": "00:58:40,638",
      "text": "♪ Had to set myself apart ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:40,672",
      "end": "00:58:42,240",
      "text": "♪ I'm just following my heart ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:42,273",
      "end": "00:58:44,175",
      "text": "♪ I'm just following my path ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:44,208",
      "end": "00:58:46,110",
      "text": "♪ I'm just here to make it last ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:46,144",
      "end": "00:58:47,679",
      "text": "♪ I'm not living in the past ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:47,712",
      "end": "00:58:49,581",
      "text": "♪ If you don't feel me, kiss my ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:49,614",
      "end": "00:58:51,749",
      "text": "♪ Uh, uh, suéltate ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:58:56,888",
      "end": "00:58:58,723",
      "text": "♪ Uh, uh, suéltate ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:04,162",
      "end": "00:59:06,297",
      "text": "♪ Uh, uh, suéltate. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:15,406",
      "end": "00:59:17,241",
      "text": "Nailed it!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:18,443",
      "end": "00:59:20,812",
      "text": "Now, didn't you say you were gonna eat your hat?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:20,845",
      "end": "00:59:22,347",
      "text": "Well, there you go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:22,380",
      "end": "00:59:24,282",
      "text": "Mmm. Yum-yum."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:34,258",
      "end": "00:59:38,630",
      "text": "♪ I love it when you call me señorita ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:38,663",
      "end": "00:59:42,767",
      "text": "♪ I wish I could pretend I didn't need ya... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:42,800",
      "end": "00:59:44,702",
      "text": "Girl, that is your fourth today."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:44,736",
      "end": "00:59:46,471",
      "text": "I know, I know."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:46,504",
      "end": "00:59:47,905",
      "text": "But I can't stop."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:47,939",
      "end": "00:59:51,442",
      "text": "It's 'cause I really want to talk to him."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:52,543",
      "end": "00:59:54,545",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:54,579",
      "end": "00:59:57,749",
      "text": "but when I get close,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:59:57,782",
      "end": "01:00:00,885",
      "text": "I get nervous, so..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:00,918",
      "end": "01:00:03,521",
      "text": "so I just buy another ice cream."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:03,554",
      "end": "01:00:07,792",
      "text": "♪ It felt like ooh-la-la-la, yeah. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:11,996",
      "end": "01:00:13,965",
      "text": "Uh, honestly, th-this is gonna be"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:13,998",
      "end": "01:00:15,700",
      "text": "the greatest show I have ever made."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:15,733",
      "end": "01:00:16,934",
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:16,968",
      "end": "01:00:18,803",
      "text": "And when you see the sets and the..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:18,836",
      "end": "01:00:20,471",
      "text": "Turn on that tap for me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:20,505",
      "end": "01:00:21,906",
      "text": "Tap? Uh, sure."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:21,939",
      "end": "01:00:23,741",
      "text": "So, anyway..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:24,542",
      "end": "01:00:25,777",
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:29,681",
      "end": "01:00:30,948",
      "text": "Oopsie-daisy."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:30,982",
      "end": "01:00:32,984",
      "text": "Moon, you okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:33,017",
      "end": "01:00:35,553",
      "text": "I'm okay!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:38,990",
      "end": "01:00:40,825",
      "text": "It's tea."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:40,858",
      "end": "01:00:42,427",
      "text": "You drink it."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:42,460",
      "end": "01:00:44,429",
      "text": "I promise,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:44,462",
      "end": "01:00:46,764",
      "text": "this is going to be the most wonderful..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:46,798",
      "end": "01:00:48,700",
      "text": "I mean, fantastic show ever."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:48,733",
      "end": "01:00:50,334",
      "text": "Did you put honey in this?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:50,368",
      "end": "01:00:52,370",
      "text": "A-And the ending? Oh, boy."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:52,403",
      "end": "01:00:54,972",
      "text": "I mean, i-it's gonna end with you"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:55,006",
      "end": "01:00:56,841",
      "text": "and your song..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:56,874",
      "end": "01:00:58,843",
      "text": "You don't want to do the show."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:00:58,876",
      "end": "01:01:02,013",
      "text": "Besides, lost my singing voice, so..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:02,046",
      "end": "01:01:04,649",
      "text": "Your voice sounds fine to me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:05,717",
      "end": "01:01:07,452",
      "text": "This..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:07,485",
      "end": "01:01:10,855",
      "text": "This is all because you lost your wife, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:10,888",
      "end": "01:01:12,957",
      "text": "Okay, porcupine."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:12,990",
      "end": "01:01:14,992",
      "text": "We're not talking about my Ruby."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:15,026",
      "end": "01:01:18,696",
      "text": "Look, I know she inspired so many of your songs..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:18,730",
      "end": "01:01:20,465",
      "text": "All of my songs."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:20,498",
      "end": "01:01:21,399",
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:21,432",
      "end": "01:01:24,469",
      "text": "I... I can't imagine what it must be like"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:24,502",
      "end": "01:01:26,671",
      "text": "to lose someone so special,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:26,704",
      "end": "01:01:31,375",
      "text": "but do you think this is what Ruby would've wanted for you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:31,409",
      "end": "01:01:35,480",
      "text": "I mean, you out here on your own"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:35,513",
      "end": "01:01:37,749",
      "text": "and never singing again?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:37,782",
      "end": "01:01:40,318",
      "text": "No, y-you don't understand."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:40,351",
      "end": "01:01:44,322",
      "text": "There's... there's no rock star living here anymore."
    }
  ],
  "mimicking": [
    {
      "start": "00:53:57,555",
